                    {
                        "question": "What is the type of assistance and entitlement? ",
                        "answer": [
                            {
                                "type": "paragraph",
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "text": "1.\tThe Scheme assists in providing good quality planting materials including horticultural tools and implements at subsidized rates for promoting fruit cultivation.\n2.\tProviding organic-based plant protection measures for the Citrus rejuvenation programme of senile orchards.\n3.\tTo assist farmers by providing a permanent trellis system for creeper fruit plants like Kiwi, Grapes etc, however, planting and erecting trellis are to be done by farmers themselves.\n4.\tTraining and capacity building of farmers."
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ],
                        "answer_md": "1.\tThe Scheme assists in providing good quality planting materials including horticultural tools and implements at subsidized rates for promoting fruit cultivation.\n2.\tProviding organic-based plant protection measures for the Citrus rejuvenation programme of senile orchards.\n3.\tTo assist farmers by providing a permanent trellis system for creeper fruit plants like Kiwi, Grapes etc, however, planting and erecting trellis are to be done by farmers themselves.\n4.\tTraining and capacity building of farmers.\n"
